I have *FINALLY* managed to install Nethack and begin 
playing.  Yesterday my Elf put on a moonstone ring.  Twenty 
turns later his armor disintegrated as he polymorphed into 
an Earth Elemental.  This occurrence was repeated many 
times: Red Dragon, male elf, Xorn, female elf, female elf, 
Vampire Bat, female elf.  The last three changes were most 
unfortunate; Cuisinart the Xorn (my pet name because it 
attacked many times, shredding opponents in the process) was
food processing a paltry pack of goblins when. . ."You are 
now a female elf". . .five turns of fleeing later. . ."You 
are now a female elf". . .flee again as the situation 
becomes more desparate. . ."You enter a vault and find lots 
of gold.  The guard says drop it and come with me.  You 
attack the guard (I was trapped with no way out). . ."You 
polymorph into a Vampire Bat" . . . (Oh JOY! Have I got him 
now!). . ."You collapse under the weight of the gold.  The 
guard pulverizes me. . ."You polymorph into a female elf". .
. And in that form I died   *Sigh*

